  "description": "The 700c Kent Front Runner is the perfect bike for commuting or those who just want to get out and explore their neighborhood. With a durable tig-welded steel frame and hi-tensile steel fork, this bike is built to last and can handle daily rides. The 7 speed drivetrain and easy to use twist shifter makes changing gears a breeze, so you can effortlessly tackle hills or pick up the pace on the flats. And with front and rear caliper brakes, you'll have the stopping power you need to ride with confidence. But it's not just about performance - the 700c Kent Front Runner also offers a comfortable ride with a height adjustable seat post, and a deluxe padded saddle that will keep you riding for longer. The lightweight alloy wheels and 700c x 38c road tires provide a smooth and efficient ride, making the Kent Front Runner a joy to ride. With its combination of durability, performance, and comfort, the Kent Front Runner hybrid bike is sure to become your go-to ride for all your adventures.",
